** TreeSet<>();

- TreeSet is the class which implements the NavigableSet Interface which extends sortedSet Interface.

TreeSet[Class]---Implements-->NavigableSet[Interface]--->Extends--->SortedSet[Interface]--Extends--->Set[Interface]

- Tree set stores elements in ascending order.
- Duplicates not allowed
- Null values are Not allowed.

















